{"unit_id":"ltayshark0637__dsh-Shutdown-Guard#feature-1","repo":"ltayshark0637/dsh-Shutdown-Guard","commit":"ad953c8054e12c691bbbb9e62945400c8af71ec4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Shutdown Guard 的功能「任务完成后关机」：用户先手动武装；所有根会话空闲、没有受阻后台任务且错误条件通过后，插件安排关机倒计时。倒计时中可取消并继续保持武装。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:1820-1844","lib/index.mjs:1881-1908"]}
